<https://w3id.org/mado#ArticulacaoDocumentada> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/mado#ConhecimentoMultimodalArticulado> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/mado#ContextoDeInteracaoDigital> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/mado#ContribuicaoNaArticulacao> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/mado#CriterioDeDecisaoMultimodal> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/mado#DecisaoDeAcessibilidadeMultimodal> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/mado#Fonte> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/mado#Resultado> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/mado#TrechoDocumental> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/mado#localizacaoDocumental> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/mado#localizacaoDocumental> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/mado#trechoDeFonte> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/mado#trechoDeFonte> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/mado#TrechoDocumental> .
<https://w3id.org/mado#trechoDeFonte> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/mado#Fonte> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtAudioReview> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArticulationSupport> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtAudioReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#addedUnderstanding> "A falta de revisão visual não impede automaticamente a tarefa: leitura em voz pode cumprir a revisão do mesmo rascunho, se conteúdo, percepção, controles e correção estiverem assegurados. É uma proposta condicionada, não prova de equivalência de compreensão." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtAudioReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#operation> "Relacionar saída de texto por síntese de fala, independência da escolha de entrada e necessidade de revisão/correção antes da conclusão." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtAudioReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#produces> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#KAudioReview> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtAudioReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#status> "CURATED_FOR_PILOT" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtInput> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArticulationSupport> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtInput> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#addedUnderstanding> "A função produzir rascunho não fica presa à voz ou ao teclado: cada entrada requer condições próprias e produz o mesmo estado informacional de projeto." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtInput> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#operation> "Relacionar equivalência funcional de entradas, operação por teclado e compatibilidade situada, sem concluir equivalência de esforço ou acesso." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtInput> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#produces> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#KInput> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtInput> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#status> "CURATED_FOR_PILOT" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtReview> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArticulationSupport> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#addedUnderstanding> "A sequência de produção e revisão só é proposta quando compartilha o mesmo rascunho e existe uma rota operável de correção; não é fusão multimodal nem complementaridade CARE automaticamente." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#operation> "Relacionar entradas e saídas independentes, possibilidade de revisão/correção e retorno perceptível para preservar o controle da pessoa." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#produces> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#KReview> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#status> "CURATED_FOR_PILOT" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArticulationSupport> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArticulationSupport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/mado#ArticulacaoDocumentada> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#AudioOutput> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Resource> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#AudioOutput> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Saída de áudio controlável"@pt .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#AudioUsable> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ContextFact> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#AudioUsable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "O áudio é utilizável no ambiente, com privacidade e percepção suficientes"@pt .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CAudioMMI> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Contribution> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CAudioMMI> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#excerpt> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ExcerptMMI> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CAudioMMI> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#inArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtAudioReview> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CAudioMMI> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#statement> "A descrição MMI inclui síntese de fala como saída e distingue a seleção de entrada da seleção de saída." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CAudioMMI> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#status> "PRIMARY_CHECKED" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CAudioReview> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Contribution> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CAudioReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#excerpt> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ExcerptReview> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CAudioReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#inArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtAudioReview> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CAudioReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#statement> "A opção de conferir e corrigir antes de concluir especifica a função de revisão; o documento não determina que ela precise ser visual." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CAudioReview> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#status> "PRIMARY_CHECKED" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CInputCARE> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Contribution> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CInputCARE> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#excerpt> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ExcerptCARE> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CInputCARE> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#inArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtInput> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CInputCARE> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#statement> "CARE permite examinar alternativas para uma mesma transição e sua compatibilidade com o usuário; não demonstra igual acessibilidade individual." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CInputCARE> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#status> "PRIMARY_CHECKED" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CInputKeyboard> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Contribution> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CInputKeyboard> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#excerpt> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ExcerptKeyboard> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CInputKeyboard> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#inArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtInput> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CInputKeyboard> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#statement> "Operação por interface de teclado fornece um requisito de acesso independente de fala; a pessoa ainda precisa conseguir operar essa entrada." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CInputKeyboard> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#status> "PRIMARY_CHECKED" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CInputLegacy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Contribution> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CInputLegacy> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#excerpt> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ExcerptLegacy> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CInputLegacy> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#inArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtInput> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CInputLegacy> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#statement> "K41 ressalta viabilidade e compatibilidade da entrada. O estado parcial do registro não é promovido a conferência do original." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CInputLegacy> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#status> "LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CReviewLegacy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Contribution> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CReviewLegacy> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#excerpt> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ExcerptLegacy> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CReviewLegacy> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#inArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtReview> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CReviewLegacy> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#statement> "K44 relaciona retorno perceptível e continuidade. Isso é apoio contextual legado, não prova de desempenho do novo fluxo." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CReviewLegacy> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#status> "LEGACY_RECORD_ONLY" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CReviewMMI> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Contribution> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CReviewMMI> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#excerpt> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ExcerptMMI> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CReviewMMI> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#inArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtReview> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CReviewMMI> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#statement> "Os requisitos MMI distinguem entradas, saídas e coordenação; o resultado de uma entrada pode ser refletido em outra forma de apresentação." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CReviewMMI> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#status> "PRIMARY_CHECKED" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CReviewWCAG> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Contribution> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CReviewWCAG> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#excerpt> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ExcerptReview> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CReviewWCAG> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#inArticulation> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ArtReview> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CReviewWCAG> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#statement> "A revisão e confirmação são uma das alternativas de prevenção de erros de submissão; o piloto escolhe essa opção, sem atribuir à fonte uma modalidade obrigatória." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CReviewWCAG> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#status> "PRIMARY_CHECKED" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CanControlPlayback> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ContextFact> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CanControlPlayback> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "A pessoa consegue pausar e repetir a leitura"@pt .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CanCorrect> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ContextFact> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CanCorrect> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Existe um meio operável para corrigir o rascunho"@pt .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CanReviewSpeech> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ContextFact> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CanReviewSpeech> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "A pessoa consegue conferir o conteúdo por fala sintetizada"@pt .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CanReviewVisualText> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ContextFact> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CanReviewVisualText> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "A pessoa consegue conferir o texto apresentado visualmente"@pt .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CanUseKeyboard> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ContextFact> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CanUseKeyboard> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "A pessoa consegue operar a interface de teclado"@pt .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CanUseSpeech> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ContextFact> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CanUseSpeech> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "A pessoa consegue e aceita usar fala nesta tarefa"@pt .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Capability> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Capability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Operação unitária de projeto, não resposta completa de um cenário nem capacidade clínica inferida."@pt .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Capability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Capacidade de interação reutilizável"@pt .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CaptureKeyboard> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Capability> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CaptureKeyboard> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Registrar por escrita"@pt .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CaptureKeyboard> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#action> "Registrar a contribuição por uma interface de teclado operável, mantendo um rascunho editável" .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CaptureKeyboard> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#inputType> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#ContributionContent> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CaptureKeyboard> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#limitation> "Teclado disponível não significa operável pela pessoa; a condição funcional precisa ser confirmada." .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CaptureKeyboard> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#mode> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#WrittenEntry> .
