<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#GroundKeyboard> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#criterion> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#CriterionInput> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#GroundKeyboard> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#justification> "A escrita oferece outra entrada para o mesmo estado de rascunho, sem exigir fala." .
