<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Review> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Function> .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Review> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Conferir e poder corrigir o rascunho"@pt .
<https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#Review> <https://w3id.org/mado/experimental/v2#order> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
